<title>USA: Oshkosh Truck declares dividends.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh Truck declares dividends.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oshkosh Truck Corp said Monday its board of directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.10875 per share for class A common stock and $0.125 per share for class B common stock.</p>
<p>These dividends, unchanged from the previous rate, will be payable August 13, 1997, to shareholders of record as of August 6, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Oshkosh shares were up 1-1/8 at 15 Monday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
